# Qud Lab refs
- Prefer `Workspace/QudLab.ModWorkspace.csproj` (or open `QudLab.code-workspace`).
- After game updates run `Setup.bat` or `qudlab sync-refs`.
- With `qudlab serve`: GET `/refs`, `/type?name=XRL.World.IPart`, `/types?q=`.
- Do not vendor CoQ DLLs. ThreadingAPI is a separate WIP mod — not part of this repo.
- See COPILOT.md.
